e},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.UG0SmRYSdbrx2rTA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"jPzO2inkjWaEr1DX"},{"type":"action","name":"Adaptive Immunity","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p>The invulnerabug gains immunity to one of the following damage types of their choice; acid, bleed, bludgeoning, cold, electricity, fire, force, mental, piercing, poison, precision, slashing, sonic, or void. This immunity lasts until the invulnerabug uses this ability again.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","option":"adaptive-immunity","suboptions":[{"label":"PF2E.TraitAcid","value":"acid"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitBleed","value":"bleed"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitBludgeoning","value":"bludgeoning"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitCold","value":"cold"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitElectricity","value":"electricity"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitFire","value":"fire"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitForce","value":"force"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitMental","value":"mental"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitPiercing","value":"piercing"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitPoison","value":"poison"},{"label":"PF2E.Damage.Precision","value":"precision"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitSlashing","value":"slashing"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitSonic","value":"sonic"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitVoid","value":"void"}],"toggleable":true,"alwaysActive":true},{"key":"Immunity","type":"{item|flags.pf2e.rulesSelections.adaptiveImmunity}"}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","polymorph"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"utdWmq8Wd4YKsg9z","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Just Won't Die","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> Once per day</p><p><strong>Trigger</strong> The invulnerabug would be reduced to 0 HP, or it would otherwise die or be destroyed</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The invulnerabug is reduced to 1 HP and doesn't die. If they have not yet cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.UG0SmRYSdbrx2rTA], they cast it immediately.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false,"frequency":{"max":1,"per":"day"}},"effects":[],"_id":"IpGUFeszVmEgo6Qo","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Prone Vulnerability","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When an invulnerabug is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, they lose their resistance to all damage; this does not impact any immunity granted by Adaptive Immunity.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"all-damage","value":10,"doubleVs":["non-magical"],"predicate":[{"not":"self:condition:prone"}]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"iKTaO7CE8RFUkwmn","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Burrow Into Flesh","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The invulnerabug's last action was a successful mandibles Strike against a Small or larger creature and the invulnerabug is not currently burrowing inside another creature</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The invulnerabug attempts to burrow into the target. The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:37] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes @Damage[3d6[persistent,bleed]] damage.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The invulnerabug burrows inside the target. The target takes @Damage[6d6[persistent,bleed]] damage. While the invulnerabug remains inside the target, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} to the invulnerabug, the invulnerabug's mandible Strikes deal an additional 2d6 precision damage to it, and it can't end the persistent bleed damage. At the end of each of its turns, the target can attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:37] save to expel the invulnerabug from its body. Additionally, the target or an adjacent creature can attempt a @Check[medicine|dc:40] check to Administer First Aid check to stop the bleeding, removing the invulnerabug on a success.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, except the target takes @Damage[10d6[persistent,bleed]] damage and checks to remove the bug take a –2 circumstance penalty.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"Xzxku2KrCC7p1QHY","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Unyielding Maw","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The invulnerabug's mandibles are made of magically enhanced adamantine. They ignore up 20 points of a target's Hardness and up to 20 of their resistance to piercing damage.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"y6f5EoEehJOXZGjZ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Relentless Tunneler","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>The invulnerabug can Burrow through any physical substance with 20 or fewer Hardness, including wood, stone, and metal. They always leave tunnels behind when they do so.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","deathN